[/LIST]
[SIZE=5][B]🔔 Update checker[/B][/SIZE]
The plugin checks the GitHub releases for a newer version when it starts and every 12 hours after that. A new version is announced once in the console. Players with [ICODE]proxytools.update[/ICODE] get a clickable message a moment after joining, and joining also refreshes a check that is older than an hour. [ICODE]/proxytools update[/ICODE] checks right away. Nothing is downloaded or installed, and only the version number is read. Set [ICODE]update-checker.enabled: false[/ICODE] in the config.yml to turn it off, or [ICODE]update-checker.download-url[/ICODE] to point admins to your download page instead of GitHub.


[SIZE=5][B]📊 Metrics[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]Uses [URL='https://bstats.org']bStats[/URL] for anonymous usage statistics, opt out in plugins/bStats/config.yml
[/LIST]

